Package: BRIVW
Title: Bivariate Rerandomized Inverse Variance Weighted Mendelian Randomization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Xin", "Liu",
           email = "xinliu_stats@hust.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the bivariate rerandomized inverse variance weighted
    estimator for Mendelian randomization with the winner's curse and sample
    structure, together with the accompanying bivariate modified Egger
    intercept test for detecting directional pleiotropy.
